      },
      "message": "docs(process): own blocked PRs first, reload line on #681 notices\n\nAdd the AGENTS.md law \"Own blocked PRs first\": before an agent claims\na new issue it fixes the open PRs of the current account that have\nconflicts or needs-rework. Reconcile \"Refresh only at merge time\".\nAdd the check to work-issue, the coordinator and the issue workers.\nThe #681 process notice now tells running sessions to reload\nAGENTS.md, .claude/agents/ and .claude/skills/, and forks to run\nfork-sync.\n\nFixes #3133\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
